llms: take the upstream qwen4exp fixes for the indexer cache and sequence state

Cherry-picked from upstream past our pin: the indexer cache restore, seq_cp and
block position keying, the recurrent state rollback, and fewer graph splits. The
call into build_attn_mha drops the argument a later upstream commit added.

Upstream also marks the architecture as unsupported for the tensor split; that line
is left out because splitting it two ways is measured to work.

